  "content": "Tim was always innovating and looking for new ways to grow the Dark Reading audience and the business. As a pioneer in the shift from print to online B2B media, Tim created new and updated elements on the Dark Reading site, and he invented more ways to engage with cyber pros, such as Dark Reading's editorial webinars , all-day virtual events (long before the pandemic), and research reports . He carved out unique \"sites within the site,\" as he called them: The Edge, Dark Reading's features section; and Dark Reading Technology, our section devoted to cyber technology and product trends.",
